<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.31 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.31 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.31 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for June 12		     6,200</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for June	     6,350</p>
<p> Average reserves to June 9			   6,457</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,307</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
